# Firebase service account private keys.
#
# Unlike google-services.json, which ships inside every APK and is not secret,
# this file authorises sending push notifications as this project. It belongs in
# EAS credentials and nowhere else. Committing one means anyone with repo access
# can wake every user's phone.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json

# Firebase Android config.
#
# Not secret in the usual sense: every value in it ships inside the APK. It is
# kept out of this public repository so the Android API key it carries is not
# handed to scrapers, and it reaches builds through the EAS file environment
# variable GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON instead. See app.config.js.
google-services.json
